656754055136622", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_146317752616743_7956279778850373632_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vgRdoqlbMP4Q7kNvwHHR_p5&_nc_oc=AdqUnG9XHBmy64rUYKVcGVGaFo4G4r2e3YEmlg7yx7UT-zsG87VbsrNn5em3dMDwvCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1mFGxQxs7MnQHNTKdpQ6CkX5KP5Dnin1fnI24f92HkSg&oe=69D63DB7"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "240391513818743", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_768510353320152_9100528013614776320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YgWhod756-gQ7kNvwG4ag9T&_nc_oc=Adr8FbV72sQOZrGaHo-nEa0vOP9XjwhjgVbz0i-tmN4GGIf51XPH38OcBLJ0pAneisY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af23ARae8QpDcWRmPKiiQ73MkUD8jdOScvEefFJyzBC1Zg&oe=69D64A76"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "217249006022269", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162706_506076726393186_5572840046471413760_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=syGsoQGGKk4Q7kNvwGaN2zN&_nc_oc=AdqqLqr28eq2Utd6MiQ94CxA5dwUO40KKjg56cJ-3k3G24SZXGgOJBV7Y_Cee-lzfA0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1RYy06dk3VZQl_XPSQhGODNmIv8zEQslUb3RP3cVClFw&oe=69D63963"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PaperLander Demo", "keywords": ["paper", "rocket", "gravity", "cute", "free"], "long_description": "PaperLander is a fragile rocket made out of - you guessed it - paper. He lives in PaperGalaxy, a low gravitational fantasy world far far away, made mostly out of paper too.\n\nBut now the Galaxy is in danger. A Space Storm is approaching and threatens to tear it apart. Only one thing can stop the Storm: The Great Anti-Storm Ion Cannon! But it works only with Proto-Stars. And Proto-Stars are scattered in the Galaxy, across its many Sectors. These Sectors are connected by a network of teleporters that activate upon landing. PaperLander's mission is to find and collect those Stars, pass through the Sectors using the teleporters and bring them to the Anti-Storm Ion Cannon in time to save the Galaxy!\n\nBuild your own PaperLander here: http://thiswayupgames.com/PaperLanderModel.pdf\n\n--------------------------------\nPlease note that this demo is not compatible with Oculus Go", "short_description": "PaperLander is a fragile rocket made out of - you guessed it - paper. He lives in PaperGalaxy, a low gravitational fantasy world far far away, made mostly out of paper too.\n\nBuild your own PaperLander here: http://thiswayupgames.com/PaperLanderModel.pdf\n\nBut now the Galaxy is in danger. A Space Storm is approaching and threatens to tear it apart. Only one thing can stop the Storm: The Great Anti-Storm Ion Cannon! But it works only with Proto-Stars, which are scattered in the Galaxy."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://thiswayupgames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://thiswayupgames.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Self Published", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://thiswayupgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "270561315209185"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162688_275788876231456_6622377002454220800_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r1H840Jj30QQ7kNvwHW18y5&_nc_oc=